                    \\\
                    X_i &amp;&amp; \underset{}{\longrightarrow} &amp;&amp; X_i
                    }
            %p
              any
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cone"} cone
              over the diagram, then by construction there is a unique function of underlying sets
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
